  "description": "Specifically For Kids\n\nTraining wheels come with 12/14/16 inch bikes, making it easy to maintain balance and learn to pedal even for young beginners\n\nChain Gurad\n\nThe chain guard well protects the chain, it will last longer than other bikes, your child will not get hurt when try to touch the chain\n\nReliable Brakes\n\nShortest travel distance grips provides extra braking efficiency, sturdy steel frame and wide tires will accompany every adventure of your little one and bring them home safe and sound\n\nEasy To Install\n\nThe children bike comes with 90% pre-assembled and assembly tools;\n\nYou can watch the assembly video on our page first before splicing kid's bicycles\n\nSize Chart\n\n12\" bike for 2-4 years (32\"-41\") toddler,\n14\" bike for 3-5 years (36\" - 47\") kids,\n16\" bike for 4-7 years (41\" - 53\") boys and girls;\n\nAdjustable seat and handlebar will give extra space when kids grow taller\n\nAbout Us\n\nHILAND had a simple yet powerful mission — to bring the joy of cycling and a healthy, positive lifestyle to everyone. From the very beginning, HILAND set out to provide affordable, high-quality bicycles that would make the freedom of riding accessible to all.\n\nWe've got our own manufacturing facilities, so we ensure that each bike we make brings top-notch performance and affordability to our amazing customers.\n\nStarry is a kid-friendly bike from Hiland, where child safety is always the primary goal. The colorful paint frame and beautiful star pattern is popular with small kids. It is easy to operate and quick to get started, contributing to a child's self-confidence. This bike is ideal for riding in the park or around the neighborhood with friends and family. Starry allows your little girl to have a comfortable and confident riding experience, even on her first ride.",
